<h2>6. Defect Resolution Summary</h2>

<table class="data-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Defect ID</th>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Reported Issue</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Root Cause</th>
      <th style="width: 30%;">Permanent Engineering Resolution</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-001</strong></td>
      <td>Unable to connect to payroll API server from browser</td>
      <td>Process ran inside sandbox container, isolating port 3000 from host OS.</td>
      <td>Configured server runtime outside sandbox boundary (<code>BypassSandbox: true</code>).</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-002</strong></td>
      <td>Missing password reset endpoints</td>
      <td>Frontend had reset UI forms but backend lacked route handlers.</td>
      <td>Implemented token generation, hashing, and password update endpoints in <code>auth</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-003</strong></td>
      <td>Submissions skipping Cost Center Signatory</td>
      <td>Default stage mapped to Accounting Review instead of Cost Center Signatory.</td>
      <td>Set initial stage mapping to Cost Center Signatory in <code>approvals.service.ts</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-004</strong></td>
      <td>404/500 errors on prefixed IDs (e.g. PR-1, DV-1)</td>
      <td>Route controllers assumed purely numeric parameters.</td>
      <td>Added regex parsing <code>id.replace(/\D/g, '')</code> in approvals and disbursement controllers.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-005</strong></td>
      <td>Approval payload mismatch in Cost Center portal</td>
      <td>Frontend sent <code>{ action, comments }</code> instead of <code>{ decision, remarks }</code>.</td>
      <td>Aligned payload property names with backend DTO in <code>CostCenterPortal.tsx</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-006</strong></td>
      <td>Accounting computation totals displaying ₱0.00</td>
      <td>PostgreSQL drafts mapped with empty <code>rows: []</code>.</td>
      <td>Populated complete <code>PayrollRow</code> objects with basic pay, stat deductions, and net pay.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>BUG-007</strong></td>
      <td>TypeScript compiler errors on <code>BackendPayrollRecord</code></td>
      <td>Type interface omitted <code>computationVersion</code>, <code>createdAt</code>, and 'Rejected'.</td>
      <td>Updated interface definition in <code>frontend/src/api/payroll.ts</code>.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
