<h2>7. Institutional Blockers & Stakeholder Decision Points</h2>

<div class="callout" style="background-color: #fffbeb; border-left-color: #f59e0b;">
  <strong>Notice on Pending External Integrations:</strong><br>
  The following items cannot be completed autonomously without formal input or credentials from MSU-Naawan administrative stakeholders:
</div>

<ol>
  <li><strong>Production SMTP Mail Gateway:</strong> Password reset tokens are generated cryptographically and logged to system audit logs. University IT must provide SMTP credentials (<code>host</code>, <code>port</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>password</code>) to enable outward email dispatch.</li>
  <li><strong>LandBank Direct SFTP / PGP Key Exchange:</strong> Compliant 150-byte fixed-width LandBank electronic payroll files are generated. LandBank must provide SFTP endpoint credentials and public PGP encryption keys.</li>
  <li><strong>Biometric Time Clock Protocol:</strong> Attendance verification, hours computation, and concern resolution are fully functional. Campus HR must provide network protocol, database link, or CSV format for on-premise biometric clocks.</li>
  <li><strong>Special Academic Allowances:</strong> Standard monthly salary, PERA, and statutory deductions are fully implemented. University Board of Regents guidelines are required to codify rates for Hazard Pay, RATA, and Night Differential.</li>
</ol>

